# Surge XT for WebCLAP

Surge XT by the Surge Synth Team, a hybrid synthesizer, ported to WebCLAP. This is not an official Surge XT release.
Lua (formula modulation, wavetable scripts), MTS-ESP and OSC are not part of this build.

**This is a modified version of Surge XT** (changes made 2026-10-10, in `patches/surge-*.patch` of the port's
source): it has no undo history of its own (the host's history covers the plugin), loads patches without a thread,
and leaves out the parts named above.

- Surge XT: https://github.com/surge-synthesizer/surge (commit 4f425b0, version 1.4.0)
- This port, and the complete source of this bundle: @SOURCE_URL@
  Build it with `scripts/build-surge-xt.sh`, which fetches every dependency below at the commit named here and
  applies the changes in `patches/surge-*.patch`.

## License

The bundle as a whole is licensed under the **GNU Affero General Public License, version 3** (`LICENSE`).

Surge XT is GPL-3.0-or-later (`licenses/GPL-3.0.txt`), except its fonts. Both modules contain the JUCE framework,
used under the AGPL-3.0, so `module.wasm` and `ui/ui.wasm` are AGPL-3.0. GPL-3.0 section 13 permits the combination.

This program is distributed in the hope that it will be useful, but WITHOUT ANY WARRANTY; without even the implied
warranty of MERCHANTABILITY or FITNESS FOR A PARTICULAR PURPOSE. See the licenses for details.

